@startuml
title SD-B05 Verifikasi Email

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 4
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #999999
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #111111
    ActorBorderColor #999999
    ActorFontColor #111111
    GroupBorderColor #111111
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
}

actor "Pengguna" as Pengguna
boundary "Email Verifikasi" as EmailVerifikasi
boundary "Halaman Verifikasi Email" as HalamanVerifikasi
control "EmailVerificationController" as EmailController
entity "Users Model" as User

Pengguna -> EmailVerifikasi : Membuka email verifikasi
Pengguna -> EmailVerifikasi : Klik tautan verifikasi
EmailVerifikasi -> HalamanVerifikasi : buka link verifikasi
HalamanVerifikasi -> EmailController : verify(id, hash, signature)
EmailController -> EmailController : validasi signed URL dan hash

alt Link valid
    EmailController -> User : cari user
    User --> EmailController : user object
    alt Email belum terverifikasi
        EmailController -> User : tandai email terverifikasi
        User --> EmailController : user diperbarui
    else Email sudah terverifikasi
        EmailController -> EmailController : lewati update
    end
    EmailController --> HalamanVerifikasi : redirect dashboard
    HalamanVerifikasi --> Pengguna : email terverifikasi
else Link tidak valid / kedaluwarsa
    EmailController --> HalamanVerifikasi : tampilkan pesan gagal
    HalamanVerifikasi --> Pengguna : verifikasi gagal
end

@enduml
